{
  "date_key": "2026-10-15",
  "date_cn": "2026年10月15日",
  "day_cn": "周四",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-10-15-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-10-15-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">职场沟通与汇报（meetings, updates, feedback loops）</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">How did the quarterly review go? I saw David heading toward the boardroom earlier, looking <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">out for blood</span>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">It was intense. He actually <strong>bailed me up</strong> by the coffee machine before it even started, demanding a quick update on the Q4 figures. Then, once we finally sat down, he basically just <strong>held court</strong> at the head of the table for the first forty-five minutes.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Classic David. I swear he just loves the sound of his own voice. Did he stick to the executive summary at least?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Not at all. He immediately decided to <strong>go off-piste</strong> and started dissecting the preliminary 2028 projections. He proceeded to <strong>waffle on</strong> about macroeconomic trends without actually giving any actionable directives.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Sounds absolutely exhausting. Were you at least able to pitch your new workflow automation plan?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I tried to <strong>run it up the flagpole</strong> during the open floor section, but I think we were just <strong>talking at cross purposes</strong>. He assumed I was advocating for headcount reductions, whereas I was purely focused on operational efficiency.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Ouch. What about the performance review portion? Did he try to <strong>soft-pedal</strong> his criticism regarding the recent marketing fiasco?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Definitely not. He didn&#x27;t <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">mince his words</span> at all. He gave the entire marketing division a spectacular <strong>dressing-down</strong> right in front of the department heads. Fortunately, their director is pretty resilient; she just let him vent and managed to <strong>take it on the chin</strong>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Fair play to her, that takes guts. Anyway, whenever you have a spare half hour this afternoon, I need you to <strong>read me in</strong> on whatever convoluted strategy he finalized today so I can start prepping my team.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">季度评审会开得怎么样？我先前看到大卫走向会议室，看起来（<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">杀气腾腾 / out for blood</span>）。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">气氛很紧张。会议还没开始，他居然就在咖啡机旁（堵住我并要我汇报 / bailed me up），非让我快速更新一下第四季度的各项数据。后来我们终于坐下开会，前四十五分钟基本上就是他坐在主位上（高谈阔论、一人主导全场 / held court）。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">典型的大卫作风。我敢说他就是喜欢听自己讲话。那他至少按着执行摘要讲了吧？</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">完全没有。他一上来就决定（脱离会议议程 / go off-piste），开始剖析2028年的初步预测。接着他又开始对宏观经济趋势（长篇大论却毫无重点地扯 / waffle on），根本没有给出任何可执行的指示。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">听起来绝对让人心力交瘁。你至少把你的新工作流自动化方案提出来了吧？</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">我确实试着在自由发言环节把这个想法（抛出来试探大家的反应 / run it up the flagpole），但我感觉我们完全是（鸡同鸭讲、误解了彼此的意图 / talking at cross purposes）。他以为我在提倡裁员，而我其实纯粹只是在关注运营效率。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">哎哟。那绩效考核环节呢？对于最近营销部门的那场灾难，他有没有（淡化、婉转处理 / soft-pedal）他的批评？</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">绝对没有。他说话一点也没有（<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">拐弯抹角 / mince his words</span>）。他当着所有部门负责人的面，把整个营销部（狠狠训斥了一顿 / dressing-down）。幸运的是，他们的总监心理素质很好；她就让他发泄，并且成功地（默默承受了批评 / take it on the chin）。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">真佩服她，这需要很大勇气。不管怎样，今天下午你只要有半小时空闲，我都需要你（向我详细通报 / read me in）他今天敲定的那些复杂战略，好让我开始让我的团队做准备。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">bail someone up</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 拦住/堵住某人（迫使其交谈或听命）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 澳大利亚 / 新西兰</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 走廊相遇或非正式场合中，某人突然被拦下要求汇报或交谈。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">hold court</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 主导谈话、高谈阔论（像国王上朝一样吸引所有人注意）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 会议中某人长篇大论，垄断了发言权，别人只能听着。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">go off-piste</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 脱离既定议程或话题（字面意为“偏离滑雪道”）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 在会议或演讲中，发言人跑题，不按幻灯片或议程来。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">waffle on</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 长篇大论却言之无物、啰嗦</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国 / 澳大利亚</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 汇报时缺乏重点，滔滔不绝地扯闲篇。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">run something up the flagpole</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 提出想法以试探公众或他人的反应</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 在会议上抛出一个新点子，看看团队成员是否支持（源自&quot;run it up the flagpole and see who salutes&quot;）。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">talk at cross purposes</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 鸡同鸭讲、因目标或理解不同而产生误解</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 沟通双方都在说话，但因为前提假设不同，完全没理解对方的真实意图。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">soft-pedal</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 淡化、婉转处理（负面消息或批评）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国 / 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 提供反馈时，为了照顾对方面子而刻意减轻批评的力度。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">dressing-down</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 严厉的训斥、痛骂</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国 / 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 上级对下级进行严厉的负面反馈或公开批评（常作 give someone a dressing-down）。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">take it on the chin</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 默默忍受挫折或严厉批评、坦然接受打击</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 面对严厉的反馈或糟糕的评审结果时，不找借口、勇敢承受。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">read someone in</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 向某人通报情况、让某人了解内情</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 将某个项目的详细背景或最新策略告知尚未参与其中的同事（源于情报界的情报授权）。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Structural teacher vulnerability and institutional discourse</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">10.1080/09518398.2026.2736694</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">teacher structural vulnerability institutional discourse bilingual education emotional labor</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">延伸已发表的教师结构性脆弱研究，而不是泛泛推荐教师压力或倦怠文献。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能把个人遭遇转化为制度机制的概念或方法，尤其关注责任、保护、可信度与教师声音。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3370925/china-shock-30-be-driven-ai-biotech-and-robot-exports-economist-says?utm_source=rss_feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">经济学家称人工智能、生物科技和机器人出口将驱动“第三次中国冲击”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">‘China shock 3.0’ to be driven by AI, biotech and robot exports, economist says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一位经济学家预测，中国出口将迎来“第三次冲击”，其主要驱动力将是人工智能、生物科技和机器人等高科技产品，这预示着全球经济格局可能因中国在高科技领域的崛起而发生重大转变。（经济分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/15/2003865986\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">陆委会批评中国大陆制裁旨在干预台湾选举</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">MAC criticizes China’s sanctions aiming at election interference</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾陆委会发表声明，谴责中国大陆对台湾采取的制裁措施，认为其目的是干预台湾即将举行的选举，此举加剧了两岸关系的紧张态势，并引发国际社会对区域稳定的关注。（台湾官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cm8xkxn8lqkeo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国大陆孤独人群为何聘请“临时子女”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Why the lonely in China are hiring &#x27;temporary children&#x27;</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着社会变迁，中国大陆部分感到孤独的人群开始聘请“临时子女”来获得情感慰藉和陪伴，这种现象反映了现代社会中老年人及独居人群日益增长的情感需求，也催生了新的服务模式。（社会观察）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/14/united-states-environmentalists-senate-clean-energy-fossil-fuels/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">环保主义者反对参议院许可协议是错误的</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Environmentalists Are Wrong to Oppose the Senate’s Permitting Deal</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章指出，环保主义者反对参议院一项关于项目许可的协议是错误的，该协议旨在简化审批流程，以加速清洁能源项目建设，作者认为这可能阻碍美国在应对气候变化方面取得进展。（评论性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/14/ice-body-cam-automatic-gao-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国移民及海关执法局拒绝强制佩戴执法记录仪</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">ICE says no to automatic body-cams</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国移民及海关执法局（ICE）表示不会强制其执法人员自动佩戴随身摄像头，这一决定引发了外界对其执法透明度和问责制的担忧，尤其是在涉及移民执法敏感性问题上。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/14/nx-s1-6001592/arctic-sea-change-rana-foroohar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">作家乘破冰船近距离观察北极的“沧海巨变”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Aboard an icebreaker, a writer got a closer look at the Arctic&#x27;s &#x27;Sea Change&#x27;</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一位作家乘坐破冰船深入北极地区，亲身目睹了该地区因气候变化而发生的“沧海巨变”，通过实地考察展现了全球变暖对北极生态环境的深远影响，呼吁公众关注气候危机。（环境纪实）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/podcasts/2026/10/david-frum-show-illia-ponomarenko-ukraine-trump/688994/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普如何出卖乌克兰</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">How Trump Is Selling Out Ukraine</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本文探讨了美国前总统特朗普在对乌克兰政策上的立场及其可能带来的影响。文章分析了其言论和行动如何被解读为损害乌克兰利益，以及这种做法对国际联盟和地缘政治格局的复杂影响。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8wy9veedgygo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">马斯克称乌克兰星链访问限制由美国而非其公司决定</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Musk says any limits on Ukraine&#x27;s Starlink access down to US, not his firm</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">埃隆·马斯克表示，对乌克兰星链服务的任何访问限制都源于美国政府的要求，而非SpaceX公司的自主决定。此言论揭示了关键基础设施在军事冲突中的复杂性，以及私人公司与政府间关系的敏感性。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bott