:1.4\">在悉尼考古学家的协助下，世界已知最古老沉船被揭示</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;World&#x27;s oldest known&#x27; shipwreck revealed with Sydney archaeologist&#x27;s help</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一支由悉尼考古学家参与的国际团队，成功揭示了一艘被认为是世界上已知最古老的沉船，这一发现为研究古代航海历史和文明交流提供了前所未有的宝贵资料。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/15/fulton-hogan-boss-warns-politicians-against-chopping-and-changing-projects/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">富尔顿·霍根公司老板警告政界人士不要频繁变更项目</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Fulton Hogan boss warns politicians against chopping and changing projects</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰大型建筑公司富尔顿·霍根的老板公开警告政界人士，频繁改变基础设施项目规划会造成巨大浪费和不确定性，呼吁政策制定者保持项目稳定性以提高效率。（商业视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/politics_election-2026/1919618/new-zealand-first-pledges-to-increase-coastguard-funding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰优先党承诺增加海岸警卫队资金投入</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">New Zealand First pledges to increase Coastguard funding</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰优先党党魁宣布，若该党在即将举行的大选中胜出，将大幅提高对新西兰海岸警卫队的支持，以增强海上救援能力和保障水域安全，此举旨在争取选民支持。（中右翼）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/travel/361046840/cruise-ship-fire-taught-me-lesson-about-room-safes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">邮轮火灾亲历记：客舱保险箱并非万无一失</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">A cruise ship fire taught me a lesson about room safes</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一位游客在经历邮轮火灾后，分享了个人物品在客舱保险箱中未能幸免的教训，提醒人们在旅行中重新审视对酒店或邮轮保险箱安全性的认知，并警示重要物品的保管风险。（个人经验）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c5zjxnm1y02po?at_medium=RSS&at_camp